        "language" : "id"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Je ontvangt geen telefoonoproepen, berichten, e-mails of FaceTime-gesprekken van personen op de blokkeringslijst.",
        "filename" : "BlocklistSettings.strings",
        "language" : "nl"
      },
      {
        "target" : "คุณจะไม่ได้รับสายโทร ข้อความ อีเมล หรือ FaceTime จากผู้คนที่อยู่ในรายการปิดกั้น",
        "filename" : "BlocklistSettings.strings",
        "language" : "th"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Você não receberá ligações telefônicas, mensagens, e‑mails ou FaceTime das pessoas que estejam na lista de bloqueio.",
